translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Dialogue_448e88ae:

    # e "Hello! Jog?"
    e "你好！乔格？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Dialogue_f7921651:

    # j "Hmm."
    j "嗯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Dialogue_91d0f62b:

    # e "Are you jog?"
    e "你是乔格吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Dialogue_e9575ac9:

    # j "Y-yes. I recognised your ass."
    j "是、是的。我认得你的屁股。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Dialogue_0584414f:

    # j "Lothar's disciple, courier, outsider?"
    j "洛萨尔的徒弟、信使、外乡人？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Dialogue_42ab47ad:

    # e "Yes, my name is [e]."
    e "没错，我叫[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Dialogue_7a43fde7:

    # j "Heh... I've got my eyes on you... and your ass... you get what I'm saying?"
    j "嘿嘿……我可盯着你呢……还有你的屁股……明白我的意思吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Dialogue_d7bf05f9:

    # e "Hmm?"
    e "嗯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Dialogue_cea61cd1:

    # j "Just don't break anything here, Lot's order."
    j "只要别把这里的东西弄坏，洛萨尔可是这么吩咐的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Dialogue_a71007f0:

    # e "Oh! Thank you so much, Jog."
    e "哦！太谢谢你了，乔格。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Dialogue_670841a4:

    # e "Hey, Jog!"
    e "嘿，乔格！"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Dialogue_45be28bc:

    # j "If it isn't the courier with that cheeks clapping! Hey, [e]."
    j "这不是那个屁股拍得啪啪响的信使吗！嘿，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Normal_Talk_8ff6718f:

    # j "What's up, Courier." nointeract
    j "怎么了，信使？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Normal_Talk_e1b4b9b5:

    # e "What about the other dudes?"
    e "其他那些家伙呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Normal_Talk_edf38b14:

    # j "Amble, and Lothar?" nointeract
    j "安布，还有洛萨尔？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Normal_Talk_58e0fbb5:

    # "As you are about to ask, you realise you are not putting on the right clothes to judge..."
    "正要开口时，你意识到自己还没穿上适合评判的衣服……"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_d608835b:

    # j "Courier, are you sure you can handle this?"
    j "信使，你确定自己应付得来吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_314eca71:

    # j "Lot told us that you can't even beat the training dummy."
    j "洛萨尔说你连训练人偶都打不过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_5ebadbf1:

    # e "That is not true."
    e "才不是那回事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_27bc135c:

    # j "Now why would Lot lie about that?"
    j "那洛哥为什么要在这事上撒谎？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_772a9682:

    # "You don't know what to say..."
    "你一时不知道该说什么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_4c0a8685:

    # j "It doesn't matter. Because I actually have a mission from him and I figure this is the perfect training opportunity for you."
    j "没关系。因为我确实接了他的任务，而且我觉得这正是训练你的绝佳机会。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_924d27d3:

    # e "What is it?"
    e "是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_d2600c43:

    # j "We're going to infiltrate into the nucleus of the goat tribe."
    j "我们要潜入山羊部落的核心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_1ea97b2d:

    # e "Why?"
    e "为什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_98b00ceb:

    # j "I've heard everything from Lot. You did good Courier."
    j "你干得不错，信使。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_39182b12:

    # j "But you are too trusting. We have to check if the goats are lying. I won't be surprised if they are."
    j "但你太容易相信人了。我们得查清那些山羊有没有撒谎。就算他们真在撒谎，我也不会意外。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_2a03d930:

    # j "He said you don't have the balls to go face the goats."
    j "他说你没胆子去面对那些山羊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_9c54f0e2:

    # j "So this will be your training. Don't worry. I'll be there to watch over your ass, figuratively and maybe literally too."
    j "所以这就是你的训练。别担心，我会在旁边照看好你的屁股——打个比方，也许字面上也是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_e4c0c14f:

    # j "He said that you got nothing even though you've successfully gained access into their tribe."
    j "他说你明明已经成功打入他们部落，却什么都没套出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_15f0701e:

    # j "That won't do. But we're going to fix that."
    j "这可不行。不过我们会把这事纠正过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_6f57a41c:

    # j "Either way, we have to find out what the goats are really up to."
    j "不管怎样，我们得查清那些山羊到底在打什么主意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_607b1c0c:

    # e "So..."
    e "所以……"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_e1a8650b:

    # e "What do you think they're up to?"
    e "你觉得他们在打什么主意？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_1e310360:

    # j "I don't know, based on their recent activity it seems they're searching for something."
    j "不知道，从他们最近的活动来看，他们似乎在找什么东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_87107475:

    # j "Not like I'd be interested unless they're taking their pants off in the middle of the forest."
    j "要不是他们在森林中央脱裤子，我才不会感兴趣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_47e7942f:

    # e "Have they?"
    e "他们真这么做了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_1501d0e9:

    # j "Maybe they have. That's the perks of being a scout, you get to see all sorts of thing."
    j "也许吧。当侦察员的好处就是能看到各种各样的事情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_bf825c4a:

    # e "Huh, what does a scout do?"
    e "呃，侦察员是做什么的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_cc082576:

    # j "Watching out for danger, being the first to explore a new area, and all."
    j "留意危险，探索新区域时冲在最前面之类的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_1a58be18:

    # j "Sometimes I do see people pulling pants off, and that's why I like what I'm doing."
    j "我有时确实会看到有人脱裤子，这就是我喜欢干这行的原因。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_d255c973:

    # e "Wouldn't you rather be the one that's... pulling their pants off?"
    e "你难道不更想成为那个……替他们脱裤子的人吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_497e4581:

    # j "What? Your brain is filled with lewd stuff much more than I do, and I won't tolerate being the second horniest person here."
    j "什么？你脑子里装的淫秽玩意儿可比我多多了，我可不能容忍自己成了这里第二好色的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_100baa4b:

    # e "I mean, do you enjoy watching people from afar more than engaging with people?"
    e "我是说，比起和人接触，你更喜欢远远地看着他们？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_bed7e178:

    # j "I don't see anything wrong with that. If it's what I'm good at then it's what it is."
    j "我没觉得那有什么不对。既然那是我擅长的事，那就这样呗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_54d4952d:

    # e "Fair enough."
    e "有道理。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_f1effd07:

    # j "Plus, if I needed any sex I'd come to you first since you're all up for this, aren't you."
    j "再说，要是我想做爱，肯定会先来找你，毕竟你不是随时都愿意来的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_2a31ed0c:

    # e "M-maybe?"
    e "或——或许吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_24e28dbc:

    # "Jog chuckles slightly."
    "乔格轻轻笑了笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_2b28d25c:

    # j "Now, I've scouted ahead and determined that our biggest obstacles is the two guards at the tribe entrance."
    j "我已经提前侦察过了，咱们最大的障碍就是部落入口处的两个守卫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_8f17d807:

    # j "How do you suggest we deal with them?"
    j "你觉得我们该怎么对付他们？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_ec0a65b5:

    # e "Uhmm... what do you think?"
    e "呃……你觉得呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_80f17ee8:

    # j "I can see there's two ways we can approach."
    j "我看有两种办法可以应对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_f0ad2a79:

    # j "First way, I see there's a rock wall near the outer wall of the goat tribe. We can hike the rock and leap over the walls."
    j "第一种，我发现山羊部落外墙附近有一道岩壁。我们可以爬上岩壁，再跃过围墙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_9145174a:

    # j "Or, I can fire an arrow and distract the two guards away from the entrance. Then, we'll sneak in."
    j "或者，我可以射出一箭，把两个守卫从入口引开。然后我们偷偷溜进去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_5e733535:

    # j "Either way, we'll have to be fast."
    j "不管选哪种办法，我们都得快点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_1328e229:

    # j "What do you think?" nointeract
    j "你觉得呢？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_690be16e:

    # e "I'll choose... Distraction?"
    e "我选……把他们引开？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_4ba3281c:

    # j "Alright, then."
    j "好，那就这么办。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_faa7d97b:

    # e "Hmm..."
    e "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_cf6bcb30:

    # e "Jog, how did you pick up archery?"
    e "乔格，你是怎么学会射箭的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_a4ed5cf0:

    # j "It... well... I never was a good survivor."
    j "这……嗯……我从来就不是什么求生能手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_70b84424:

    # j "I was left all alone, when I was very very young. Much like a little kid."
    j "我还很小很小的时候，就被一个人丢下了，那时还只是个小孩子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_ab989c47:

    # j "And, I have to tell you this, I never liked being in the village. Most of the time I go to the forest and have fun."
    j "还有件事得告诉你：我从来不喜欢待在村子里。大多数时候，我都会去森林里玩个痛快。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_0af3dc39:

    # j "I picked up the bow pretty early on, not an exciting story really. I just practised outside with Amble."
    j "我很早就开始练弓了，真没什么精彩故事。我只是和安布在外面练习。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_30aabf79:

    # j "But I didn't live with him until much later on."
    j "不过，直到很久以后我才和他一起生活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_00ea2360:

    # e "Did you practice a lot?"
    e "你们练得很勤吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_8fcd8f9d:

    # j "Of course. Speaking of, it was Amble who carved and set up the archery range in town."
    j "当然。说起来，村里的射箭场可是安布亲手雕刻并搭建的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_71ac22ca:

    # j "We hang out there when we're in the village."
    j "我们在村里的时候，都会去那里消磨时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_bdf5e14e:

    # j "But sometimes, the bear and I are up to something else."
    j "不过有时候，我和那头熊会去做些别的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_1eee6c19:

    # j "Let's just say on those times, I'd be handling something a lot more heftier than my bow."
    j "就这么说吧，那种时候，我手上摆弄的东西可比我的弓粗壮多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_0013fb52:

    # e "...heftier?"
    e "……更粗壮？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_e580fec2:

    # j "If I explain it it wouldn't be as much fun, [e]."
    j "要是我解释清楚了，就没那么有趣了，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_8760c7a4:

    # e "I'll choose... Sneaking?"
    e "我选……偷偷潜入？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_4ba3281c_1:

    # j "Alright, then."
    j "好，那就这么办。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_74c0edcd:

    # e "So... Jog, how did you get designated as the scout?"
    e "说起来……乔格，你是怎么被指定为侦察员的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_7dba1335:

    # j "The role came naturally to me."
    j "这个职位对我来说是自然而然的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_1bc4428a:

    # j "I was born... well. not as strong as the others."
    j "我出生时……嗯，没其他人那么强壮。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_08b467f6:

    # j "But, you know. It has its benefits, despite those other's pesky jeering and all."
    j "不过你知道的，尽管那些家伙总爱烦人地嘲笑我，小个子也有它的好处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_b29c0448:

    # j "I can escape people's detection quite easily and I can fit into small crooks others can't."
    j "我很容易就能躲过别人的察觉，还能钻进其他人进不去的小缝隙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_9ab8d17c:

    # e "That sounds useful."
    e "听起来很有用。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_32aa90e9:

    # "Jog looks over and cracks a smile."
    "乔格转过头来，咧嘴一笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_7f14f4ef:

    # j "Well, you have no idea how many perks you'll get by just staying hidden."
    j "只要躲起来，你能得到多少好处，真是想都想不到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_7ba49542:

    # j "Let's just say Lusterfield lives up to the Lust in its name."
    j "这么说吧，乐斯特菲尔德这个名字里的“淫乐”，可不是白叫的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_0bfa5f0f:

    # j "Stuff sometimes get left behind after sex."
    j "做爱之后，有时会留下些东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_4707b364:

    # j "Speaking of, a free tip."
    j "说到这个，免费送你一条小建议。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_6ef4031b:

    # j "That lizard friend of yours at the shop packs a big one. You might want to prepare yourself before you proceed further."
    j "你在店里的那位蜥蜴朋友，家伙可大着呢。继续之前，你最好先做好准备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_734ba8f5:

    # "Jog winks mischievously at you."
    "乔格淘气地朝你眨了眨眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_6092ec23:

    # j "I may or may not know from experience. Haha."
    j "我可能是凭经验知道的，也可能不是。哈哈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_a968419e:

    # "Soon... you and Jog arrive at the Goat Tribe."
    "很快……你和乔格来到了山羊部落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_9b0cb92c:

    # "You hide behind a bush."
    "你躲到一丛灌木后面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_740732b9:

    # j "Be prepared. I'll shoot an arrow."
    j "做好准备。我会射出一箭。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_eff8f55b:

    # j "Once the goats go investigating after it, we'll leg it into the tribe."
    j "等山羊去调查那东西，我们就赶紧溜进山羊部落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_7edf1262:

    # j "Keep your body low to the ground."
    j "身体尽量压低，贴近地面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_93933b83:

    # "You and Jog stop at the rock wall."
    "你和乔格在石墙前停下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_3db81432:

    # j "You should be able to find purchases on the crevices."
    j "你应该能在石墙的缝隙里找到落脚点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_be498226:

    # j "When you reach a certain height, just jump over the wall."
    j "到了合适的高度，就直接翻过墙去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_a60bdef1:

    # j "There are bushes on the other side to cushion your fall."
    j "另一边有灌木丛，能帮你缓冲落地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_83fa10b1:

    # "Jog stares at your butt."
    "乔格盯着你的屁股。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_1d6570d5:

    # j "You have some padding back there to help with your landing too. They are more than just pleasing to the eyes."
    j "你后面还有些肉垫，落地时也能帮上忙。那可不只是养眼而已。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_2116348c:

    # "The plan carries on smoothly. You and Jog find your way to the window of the chieftain's hut."
    "计划进行得很顺利。你和乔格一路找到了族长小屋的窗边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_7eb028bb:

    # "You hear conversation drifting out from inside."
    "你听见里面传来隐约的谈话声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_82091822:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_f9e4b388:

    # k "This is so hard. Furk, this is impossible."
    k "太难了。弗坎，这根本不可能。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_bcf8625c:

    # "You hear Kari groans."
    "你听见卡里发出呻吟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_de185e2c:

    # f "You just need to power it through like we usually do."
    f "你只要像我们平时那样使劲撑过去就行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_07ee055c:

    # k "It's too tight. It won't go through."
    k "太紧了，根本进不去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_567dd6c7:

    # f "How about we oil them a little to loosen things up?"
    f "要不给它们涂点油，让它们松一松？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_344aa336:

    # k "You're asking for too much. There's no way it'll fit."
    k "你这是强人所难，根本不可能塞进去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_2ef9cfa7:

    # f "We've done it before, so why won't it work now?"
    f "我们以前明明成功过，为什么现在不行？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_ed1372b0:

    # k "Things have changed. That has gotten bigger."
    k "情况变了。它已经变大了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_1b15e498:

    # "You blush hearing the conversation. You look over at Jog."
    "听着这段对话，你羞红了脸，转头看向乔格。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_591a075a:

    # "Jog was looking at you with a dirty grin."
    "乔格正带着淫笑看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_912d8371:

    # j "{size=30} Well, I was not expecting that.{/size}"
    j "{size=30}嗯，我可没想到会听到这个。{/size}"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_a1e06bf6:

    # e "{size=30} What should we do?{/size}"
    e "{size=30}我们该怎么办？{/size}"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_84b45f52:

    # "The two in the hut begins to talk again."
    "小屋里的两人又开始说话了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_5781f082:

    # k "Furkan, you are not going to get Lusterfield to agree to this."
    k "弗坎，你不可能让卢斯特菲尔德同意这件事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Lothar_Training_5f5be285:

    # "Kari sighs."
