    ar "不，我得照料庄稼，没空像条脾气暴躁的老猎犬似的去抓偷李子的贼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Arthur_Bandit_Meet_Quest_e1a5405e:

    # "Arthur pauses for a second."
    "亚瑟停顿了一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Arthur_Bandit_Meet_Quest_ec2b9166:

    # ar "What I'm saying is, these scumbags are sneaky, but if a pup wishes to help with pest extermination just like what you did with the landsharks, there's no one to stop you."
    ar "我的意思是，那些人渣很会偷偷摸摸。不过，要是你这小子想帮忙除掉这些害虫，就像你之前对付陆鲨那样，没人拦得住你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Arthur_Bandit_Meet_Quest_7d807496:

    # e "Do I... get a reward for this?"
    e "我……能得到奖励吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Arthur_Bandit_Meet_Quest_5f7a7c8a:

    # ar "You already had one with another fella, pup."
    ar "你已经从另一个家伙那里领过一次奖励了，小子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Arthur_Bandit_Meet_Quest_eb5f2d46:

    # "Arthur points in the general direction somewhere towards Lusterfield."
    "亚瑟朝着大致通往璐斯特菲尔德的方向指了指。"

translate schinese_rewrite Arthur_Bandit_Meet_Quest_57064ab4:

    # ar "If you want to help, I know something that might deem useful to you. I counted 3 occasions where my plums went missing."
    ar "如果你想帮忙，我倒是知道一件或许对你有用的事。我数过了，我的李子一共丢过3次。"

translate schinese_rewrite Arthur_Bandit_Meet_Quest_a68f52a7:

    # ar "I checked the grove garden every eight in the morning, the first day I saw them missing was, 2pm. The second, well- four. And the third, it was at around 12."
    ar "我每天早上八点都会去检查果园，第一天发现李子不见是在下午两点。第二天嘛——四点。第三天则是在十二点左右。"

translate schinese_rewrite Arthur_Bandit_Meet_Quest_1e4d7261:

    # e "Do they come at a specific time?"
    e "他们会在特定的时间来吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Arthur_Bandit_Meet_Quest_0c8f4ddd:

    # ar "They came in a pattern, was what I was saying. Perhaps if you wait in the farmland around that time you'd catch the thief red-handed."
    ar "我说的是，他们出现得很有规律。你要是那时候在农田里守着，说不定能把小偷当场抓住。"

translate schinese_rewrite Arthur_Bandit_Meet_Quest_e69a7083:

    # ar "It's all predictions, pup. Once you've been working on the farm for a couple of decades. You've sort of seen it all."
    ar "这都只是推测，小子。你在农场干上二十来年之后，也算什么都见过了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Arthur_Bandit_Meet_Quest_6eadaf0a:

    # "Arthur sighs, looking over the endless field."
    "亚瑟叹了口气，望向一望无际的田野。"

translate schinese_rewrite Arthur_Bandit_Meet_Quest_44960d48:

    # ar "Welp, time to work."
    ar "好了，该干活了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Arthur_Bandit_Meet_Quest_cc6111a7:

    # ar "Good luck looking for the thief, pup, but stay inside the farm, that way I can actually protect you from any threats."
    ar "祝你找小偷顺利，小子，不过待在农场里。这样真遇到什么威胁，我才能保护你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Arthur_Bandit_Meet_Quest_c7f4b7b8:

    # e "Thanks, M-master."
    e "谢谢，主、主人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Arthur_Bandit_Meet_Quest_05376674:

    # e "Thanks, Arty."
    e "谢谢，阿蒂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Arthur_Bandit_Meet_Quest_Inquire_3f030f5d:

    # e "Master, may I ask again what I should do to catch the thief?"
    e "主人，我能再问一次该怎么抓住小偷吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Arthur_Bandit_Meet_Quest_Inquire_43e23dc8:

    # e "Arty, what should I do to catch the thief again?"
    e "阿蒂，我要怎么才能再抓到那个小偷？"

translate schinese_rewrite Arthur_Bandit_Meet_Quest_Inquire_9219fe18:

    # ar "It's easy, when it's morning, walk around right back there in the grove of harvest where the plums are at."
    ar "事情很简单。早上去后面那片种李子的果园转转。"

translate schinese_rewrite Arthur_Bandit_Meet_Quest_Inquire_354646fc:

    # ar "If they're greedy for more of the juicy plums, you'll see them there."
    ar "要是他们还贪图更多汁的李子，你就能在那里看到他们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Arthur_Bandit_Meet_Quest_Inquire_2e0e5329:

    # e "Oh! Thank you again!"
    e "哦！再次谢谢你！"

translate schinese_rewrite Arthur_Bandit_Meet_Quest_Inquire_deef2f01:

    # ar "Good, good pup."
    ar "乖，乖孩子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_b3d216a9:

    # e "Jog, is there something wrong?"
    e "乔格，是出什么事了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_59945ea0:

    # j "What do you mean, something on my face? Amble broke the bucket again?"
    j "你说我脸上有什么？安布又把桶弄坏了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_3e7c581c:

    # e "No, I mean generally, but what happened to the bucket...?"
    e "不，我是说总体上……不过桶是怎么回事……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_76789085:

    # j "Ah, go ask Amb if you wanna know. But I do have something else on my hand at the moment."
    j "啊，想知道就去问安布吧。不过我现在手上确实还有别的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_9c18a15c:

    # a "Hey, puny friend. Good to see you here."
    a "嘿，小不点朋友。很高兴在这里见到你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_3fb1cb68:

    # "A familiar red coloured bear walks inadvertently, with a few similarly coloured apples on his hands."
    "一头熟悉的红色熊不经意地走来，手里拿着几个同样红色的苹果。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_e0f2125c:

    # j "Amb, you've got those precious red plums?"
    j "安布，你拿到那些珍贵的红色李子了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_df0f5fb0:

    # a "Oh, about that. I saw only a few rotten ones in the trees, but Arty gave me these healthy looking ones instead-"
    a "哦，说到这个。我只在树上看到几颗腐烂的，但亚瑟给了我这些看起来很新鲜的——"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_749cfd80:

    # j "You idiot, these are apples! Not plums. Did that old dog tell you it's even more tastier than the real ones?"
    j "你这个笨蛋，这些是苹果！不是李子。那条老狗是不是告诉你，它们甚至比真正的李子还好吃？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_bffee593:

    # a "Wait, were you following me? How did you know..."
    a "等等，你一直在跟踪我吗？你怎么会知道……"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_e3c9ac92:

    # j "You oaf."
    j "你这个蠢货。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_b8b67533:

    # "The snarky hyena grins at the dumbfounded Amble."
    "那只嘴欠的鬣狗朝目瞪口呆的安布咧嘴一笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_14117f2e:

    # j "And I asked for a basket, what happened?"
    j "而且我让你拿个篮子来，结果呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_b1f3a375:

    # a "The last time I checked they were fine, but today the plums all disappeared, and I could only see some red juice stains on the grass."
    a "我上次查看时它们还好好的，可今天李子全都不见了，我只能在草地上看到一些红色果汁的痕迹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_ba16a4b4:

    # e "Did someone steal from the farm? I didn't see anyone doing that in broad daylight."
    e "有人从农场偷东西了吗？光天化日之下，我没看到有人这么做啊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_05a4fd30:

    # j "And what I see, is someone getting hungry for these juicy babies. I'll miss them."
    j "可我看到的是，有人正对这些多汁的小宝贝垂涎欲滴。我会想念它们的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_6c1b7787:

    # "You notice Jog grabbing the apples from Amble, before munching down onto one of the red fruits."
    "你注意到乔格从安布手里拿过苹果，随后大口啃起其中一个红色果实。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_753797d9:

    # e "You aren't going to find out who took the plums?"
    e "你不打算查出是谁拿走了李子吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_1f431793:

    # j "No, Amble and I already know who did it."
    j "不，安布和我已经知道是谁干的了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_999bd7db:

    # a "W-wait, I don't know who stole your plums."
    a "等、等等，我不知道是谁偷了你的李子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_5bb80a41:

    # e "Me neither."
    e "我也不知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_9866ae96:

    # "Jog takes another bite out of the apple, making loud crunch noises after another."
    "乔格又咬了一口苹果，接连发出响亮的咔嚓声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_3671e98f:

    # j "Well, if you want to find out what's out there, be my guest, go ask Arthur about the area and follow that trail or whatever Amble was talking about."
    j "那你要是想弄清外面有什么，尽管去吧。去问问亚瑟这片区域的情况，再沿着那条路走，或者按安布说的随便什么都行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_fe8b36bc:

    # j "Amble and I have been out here scouting and fixing roads for a while, but you should still be cautious."
    j "我和安布已经在这里侦察、修路有一阵子了，不过你还是得小心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_cd75e2f3:

    # j "If it's safe for you to walk on it, it's safer for them to walk as well."
    j "如果你走在上面是安全的，那对他们来说走上去就更安全了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_14e9b6d5:

    # a "Puny friend, I should go with you for extra safety."
    a "小不点朋友，我应该陪你去，这样更安全。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_db90bb99:

    # "You feel warmer upon hearing Amble, but it soon dissipates as Jog yanks on the bear's hand hard to drag Amble towards him."
    "听到安布的话，你觉得暖意上涌，但乔格很快用力拽住熊人的手，把安布拖向自己，那股暖意随即消散。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_0c9cf0a8:

    # j "You stay! I'm not done with your abs."
    j "你留下！我还没摸够你的腹肌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_95d7112e:

    # j "Sorry, [e]. Amble's too busy, he can't go with you."
    j "抱歉，[e]。安布忙得很，他不能陪你去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_8a93bdbd:

    # e "It's ok, I can handle myself."
    e "没事，我自己应付得来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_1d0fc1e2:

    # "Amble gives you an awkward smile as he sits on the hay piles."
    "安布坐在干草堆上，朝你露出一个尴尬的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_23ac6cc2:

    # j "But, anyway, if you can get me some of those plums back. I'll teach you how to perform a piercing blow."
    j "不过话说回来，如果你能把那些李子找回来，我就教你怎么使出穿刺打击。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_7bfb4651:

    # e "Is... that it?"
    e "就……这样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_33dd65c9:

    # "Jog gives you a side glance, and then chuckles."
    "乔格侧眼瞥了你一眼，然后轻笑起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_30a614b7:

    # j "Since when did you learn to talk like this?"
    j "你从什么时候学会这样说话了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_73420d35:

    # j "Alright, Amble will give you 400 gold as well, enough for your greedy ass?"
    j "好吧，安布还会给你400枚金币，这够你这个贪心鬼满意了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_ac7f43e9:

    # e "I guess that's enough for my greedy ass."
    e "我想，这够满足我这个贪心鬼了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_f13d36d7:

    # j "Good, now get your ass out there and bring me back the plums before I get a hold of it."
    j "很好，现在赶紧滚出去把李子带回来，免得我亲自抓住你的屁股。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_79114e0b:

    # e "Maybe I'll check it out later."
    e "也许我晚点再去看看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_b2e57b61:

    # j "Plums don't wait, but I'll be eating my apples until your lazy ass comes back."
    j "李子可不会等人，不过在你这个懒鬼回来之前，我会一直吃我的苹果。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_3d65667c:

    # "The two wave you goodbye, before talking among themselves."
    "两人向你挥手道别，然后彼此交谈起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_0e97eca1:

    # "Unable to hear their conversation, you take your leave swiftly."
    "听不见他们在说什么，你迅速离开了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_Inquire_e7cda083:

    # e "Jog, I think I will look for your plums, what should I do again?"
    e "乔格，我想去找你的李子，我该怎么做来着？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_Inquire_7c71b49a:

    # j "Good, you can't let these juicy devils go to waste in somebody else's belly, much like cum."
    j "很好，你可不能让这些多汁的小恶魔浪费在别人肚子里，就像精液一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_Inquire_d94c27a1:

    # "Jog gives you an evil grin and licks his lip intently."
    "乔格冲你露出邪恶的笑容，专注地舔了舔嘴唇。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_Inquire_553298f9:

    # j "Just go to the old farmer's place, he'll tell you about the problem, stop the thief, and perhaps get me back the plums, if they're not already in someone else's belly."
    j "直接去老农的住处，他会告诉你出了什么问题。你制止小偷，说不定还能把李子给我带回来——如果它们还没进别人的肚子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_Inquire_24ccf0c3:

    # e "Is there anything I need to be careful of?"
    e "有什么需要我小心的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_Inquire_27c841c5:

    # "The hyena stares at you for a moment, before taking another bite out of his apple."
    "那只鬣狗盯着你看了一会儿，然后又咬了一口他的苹果。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_Inquire_2c405ba7:

    # j "Just don't wander off the farm, you know. Stranger danger."
    j "你知道，只要别在农场外面乱逛就行。陌生人很危险。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_Inquire_d44e5b62:

    # j "Someone might take your money, and probably get your ass eaten, figuratively."
    j "有人可能会抢走你的钱，还很可能让你吃不了兜着走——我是说比喻意义上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Meet_Quest_Inquire_7115ea73:

    # e "A-alright."
    e "好、好的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_56fdbe7a:

    # e "About the plums..."
    e "关于李子……"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_1b2d8036:

    # "Jog glances at you, his face immediately turns serious."
    "乔格瞥了你一眼，脸色立刻变得严肃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_de1c3315:

    # j "You've caught the thief?"
    j "你抓到那个小偷了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_92f16cc0:

    # e "Yeah."
    e "嗯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_54c0be6e:

    # e "It was a rat, he said he is a bandit or something."
    e "是只老鼠，他说自己是个强盗什么的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_cf6b48e3:

    # j "What happened to him?"
    j "他怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_c05d3456:

    # e "Uh... I let him take the plums and leave."
    e "呃……我让他拿走李子后离开了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_b00f9d2e:

    # e "But he's not coming back, which's the most important thing, right?"
    e "但他不会再回来了，这才是最重要的，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_2b635f62:

    # j "Maybe, why did he come here?"
    j "也许吧，他为什么会来这里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_398bcdfa:

    # e "He, uh. uh. H-he thought he was safe, because of hyena."
    e "他、呃，呃……他以为自己是安全的，因为有鬣狗在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_81aa04ff:

    # "Jog raises his brows, you're certain his glare isn't a kind one."
    "乔格挑了挑眉，你确信他的目光并不友善。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_49246578:

    # j "Something about me?"
    j "他说了什么和我有关的事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_ed9d0ede:

    # e "Yeah, he said something along the line of the hyena will keep him safe."
    e "嗯，他说了些类似鬣狗会保护他、让他安全的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_28a29dd3:

    # e "Well, I've got the plums, right here."
    e "嗯，李子就在我这儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_23c60c13:

    # j "W-well, and I was starting to get used to the taste of these apples."
    j "呃、呃，我都开始习惯这些苹果的味道了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_cf1167ef:

    # e "I beat him up pretty badly. Doesn't seem like he's coming back."
    e "我把他揍得够呛。他看来是不会回来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_9773434e:

    # e "I don't think so either. He begged to keep the plums though. I didn't give him back."
    e "我也不这么认为。不过他求我让他留下李子，我没还给他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_2de3a988:

    # j "Good, now I can finally enjoy these plums without these pesky varmints getting in the way."
    j "很好，现在终于能好好享用这些李子了，不用再让那些讨厌的害虫碍事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_f0a0a70c:

    # "Jog sounds disinterested. Almost void of any emotion despite getting the plums back."
    "乔格听起来毫不在意。尽管拿回了李子，他几乎没有流露出任何情绪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_912927ea:

    # e "You know about him?"
    e "你知道他的事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_b4fa3fc0:

    # j "..."
    j "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_e4cb7ac5:

    # e "He talked about a hyena before, I thought it was talking ab-."
    e "他之前提到过一只鬣狗，我还以为他说的是——"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_213afb95:

    # j "What do you think?"
    j "你觉得呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_6535c757:

    # e "Ah?"
    e "啊？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_d215981f:

    # e "Well, I followed him outside the farm."
    e "嗯，我跟着他出了农场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_b4fa3fc0_1:

    # j "..."
    j "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_fc4f2e72:

    # j "Did I not tell you to not go outside."
    j "我不是告诉过你别出去吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_b1fb7d4c:

    # e "Ye-yes, but I wanted to see who he was."
    e "是、是啊，但我想看看他是谁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_6cabd9d9:

    # j "You don't really listen, do you?"
    j "你还真是不听话，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_14261e80:

    # "Jog sighs."
    "乔格叹了口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_cbdbf618:

    # j "I knew you were reckless as hell when you chose to distract those goats back then."
    j "你那次选择去引开那些山羊时，我就知道你鲁莽得要命。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_da622ac7:

    # j "What did you find out, then."
    j "那你查到了什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_30bc96f5:

    # e "He was a rat and I followed him to their hideout."
    e "他是只老鼠，我跟着他去了他们的藏身处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_6ab4687b:

    # e "I saw a shark, I think he is probably from the bandits."
    e "我看到了一只鲨鱼，我觉得他多半是强盗的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_16c0650b:

    # e "And... I got caught there."
    e "而且……我在那里被抓住了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_01cc306b:

    # e "I didn't know what to do, so I just lied, saying I was a recruit, just to get out."
    e "我不知道该怎么办，所以只好撒谎，说自己是新招募的，只为脱身。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_27ddaf2a:

    # j "O-ok."
    j "好、好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_c8e615f4:

    # j "You knew about the red food thing?"
    j "你知道那个红色食物的事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_f781326f:

    # e "I didn't know, I just guessed, I guess."
    e "我不知道，我只是猜的，大概吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_c0eebb2d:

    # j "S-so what. You're a bandit now?"
    j "所、所以呢。你现在成强盗了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_5f435be0:

    # e "They think I am, but not really."
    e "他们以为我是，但其实不是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_30bc0c54:

    # j "Are you joking right now? Did that shark just let you go like that?"
    j "你现在是在开玩笑吗？那条鲨鱼就这么放你走了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_b0b48626:

    # e "Y-yeah."
    e "嗯、嗯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_9f37517e:

    # j "...Boring."
    j "……无聊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_5a2b0c40:

    # j "Did they say something... about a hyena?"
    j "他们有没有说过什么……关于鬣狗的事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_92f16cc0_1:

    # e "Yeah."
    e "嗯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_d494d9b3:

    # e "I just won against him, he said he wouldn't come again."
    e "我刚赢了他，他说不会再来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_426e5ab5:

    # j "And you trust him?"
    j "你就信他？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_84e7f73f:

    # e "Yeah, I do."
    e "对，我信。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_c1fe543f:

    # j "You'd trust a bandit?"
    j "你会相信一个强盗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_3a14a5ef:

    # e "I trust a bandit that's just been beaten up."
    e "我信一个刚挨过打的强盗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_3b37cfc7:

    # e "Not really, but I'll have to take his word for now."
    e "也说不上，不过现在我只能先相信他的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_1adc08d8:

    # j "If you piss him off you'll have a whole band of bandits storming Lusterfield, you know."
    j "你要是惹恼了他，整伙强盗可就会冲进光泽镇了，知道吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_9ab19e39:

    # e "...Uh. I didn't think that part through."
    e "……呃。我没想到这一层。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_12f4457a:

    # e "He did mention a hyena in Lusterfield, though."
    e "不过，他确实提到过光泽镇里有一只鬣狗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_a5a6fa0b:

    # e "And I limped back to Lusterfield."
    e "我还一瘸一拐地回了光泽镇。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_8d76519e:

    # j "You can't be too careless."
    j "你可不能太大意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_1adc08d8_1:

    # j "If you piss him off you'll have a whole band of bandits storming Lusterfield, you know."
    j "你要是惹恼了他，整伙强盗可就会冲进光泽镇了，知道吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_9ab19e39_1:

    # e "...Uh. I didn't think that part through."
    e "……呃。我没想到这一层。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_12f4457a_1:

    # e "He did mention a hyena in Lusterfield, though."
    e "不过，他确实提到过光泽镇里有一只鬣狗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_70ae7c5d:

    # j "And hyena, huh."
    j "还有鬣狗啊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_213afb95_1:

    # j "What do you think?"
    j "你觉得呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_Meet_Quest_6535c757_1:

    # e "Ah?"
    e "啊？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_d84c5efc:

    # j "He was talking about me, what do you think?" nointeract
    j "他指的是我，你觉得呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_26de6fe0:

    # e "I think he was talking about another hyena? Maybe he recognised a hyena from another place."
    e "我觉得他说的是另一只鬣狗？也许他认出的是来自别处的鬣狗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_2d4618b3:

    # j "N-no I'm pretty sure he's talking about me."
    j "不、不，我很确定他说的就是我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_67e6ee5b:

    # j "Now, am I the one that helped those guys?"
    j "难道帮助过那些家伙的是我？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_900d1dda:

    # e "I was just thinking, maybe you... knew him?"
    e "我只是想，也许你……认识他？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_3b259224:

    # j "Do you think I helped those guys take advantage of the village?"
    j "你觉得我帮那些人占了村子的便宜？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_de54dc83:

    # e "Of course not, I look fondly of you, Jog."
    e "当然不是，我很喜欢你，乔格。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_1f66d807:

    # e "You're not like them at all."
    e "你和他们完全不一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_cde5a5ec:

    # "Jog unclenches his fist, he stares at you."
    "乔格松开拳头，注视着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_1d32c660:

    # j "Why do you think that?"
    j "你为什么这么想？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_48dc4429:

    # e "Well, I think you're pretty witty and funny, and you treat your friends really well."
    e "我觉得你挺机灵幽默的，对朋友也特别好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_18ed5aef:

    # e "That, I don't see in any of them."
    e "这一点，我在他们任何一个人身上都没看出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_b4fa3fc0:

    # j "..."
    j "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_68894f63:

    # "Jog looks away, his face filled with bewilderment."
    "乔格移开视线，脸上满是困惑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_75b24aca:

    # j "Huh."
    j "呃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_c07d1989:

    # j "Did Sebas not warn you about me?"
    j "塞巴斯没警告过你要当心我吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_16831bc7:

    # e "I don't think that matters at all, really."
    e "我真觉得那一点根本不重要。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_a2da7475:

    # e "I can see it with my own eyes, and you're a good friend."
    e "我亲眼就能看出来，而且你是个很好的朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_b4fa3fc0_1:

    # j "..."
    j "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_3327a0de:

    # j "A-alright."
    j "好、好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_c3fc3d96:

    # j "W-Who taught you to talk with butter in your mouth, was it Arthur?"
    j "谁教你说话这么甜的，是亚瑟吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_3dd6a59e:

    # e "No, not really, I really mean it well, Jog."
    e "不，不是，我是真心这么认为的，乔格。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_956be20e:

    # "The hyena ponders for a minute."
    "鬣狗沉思了片刻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_6ab089c5:

    # j "...S-shit."
    j "……该、该死。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_e7e3fee3:

    # j "You know, I had been thinking of a way to know what you would think about me for a long time, and I didn't once expect that answer at all."
    j "你知道吗，我一直在想办法弄清楚你怎么看我，可我一次都没料到你会这么回答。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_ca93db12:

    # j "Usually I wouldn't ask you to get the plums for me, if not for seeing how you'd react."
    j "要不是想看看你会怎么反应，我平时才不会让你替我去拿李子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_fd652b7c:

    # e "Well you could've just asked me directly."
    e "你直接问我不就行了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_3e9e6629:

    # j "Yeah, but that wouldn't be fun."
    j "是啊，但那样就没意思了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_c6a1cf8b:

    # "Jog chuckles."
    "乔格轻笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_4a977777:

    # j "I know them, the bandits, I had been one of them a long time ago."
    j "我了解他们，那些强盗；很久以前我也是他们中的一员。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_a76f081c:

    # j "I really thought I'd be a bandit for the rest of my life, I thought it became a part of me."
    j "我真以为自己会一辈子当个强盗，我以为那已经成了我的一部分。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_44e56039:

    # j "But I got kicked out, for not being fierce enough."
    j "但我被赶了出来，因为我还不够凶狠。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_a01f5f59:

    # j "The fun part is, after I returned to Lusterfield, Sebas took me in, and they too kicked me out, because of something I didn't do."
    j "有意思的是，我回到卢斯特菲尔德后，塞巴斯收留了我，可他们又把我赶了出去，就因为一件我没做过的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_bfe6a121:

    # j "Because, there was no other thief in the house other than me."
    j "因为那屋里除了我之外，没有别的小偷。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_cc31ec5d:

    # j "It was fun, I loved that."
    j "那真有意思，我可喜欢了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_5681eb4e:

    # "It doesn't look like Jog is having fun saying it, and you stare at him with concern."
    "看起来乔格说这话时并不开心，你担忧地注视着他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_039446e9:

    # j "Amble was the only one stupid enough to let me sleep in his place. he said I was good at scouting, hiding and warning people of monsters."
    j "安布是唯一一个蠢到会让我睡在他那儿的人。他说我很擅长侦察、躲藏，还能提醒别人有怪物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_5f2588ba:

    # j "He's the oaf that doesn't really see the worst in people."
    j "他就是那种看不到人性最坏一面的蠢货。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_69b1ea80:

    # j "Perhaps you're an oaf too."
    j "说不定你也是个蠢货。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_f2f2dd62:

    # e "I am?"
    e "我吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_9396e944:

    # j "Ha, you're a sexy oaf, I'll give you that. But Amble's got that cake I can eat for all day."
    j "哈，你确实是个性感的蠢货，这点我承认。不过安布那屁股，够我吃上一整天。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_e19eeae9:

    # "He smirks."
    "他露出一抹坏笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_edbbe909:

    # j "And Lot, for a village hero he's another kind of oaf that protects his friends at all cost, regardless of right and wrong."
    j "还有洛特，作为村里的英雄，他是另一种蠢货：不管对错，都会不惜一切代价保护朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_e572e1b3:

    # j "You're really lucky to be his disciple, you know that."
    j "能成为他的弟子，你可真是走运，知道吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_b846c3e7:

    # j "And- if I was like Ole, I'd be scolding you for a whole year for not listing to me and sneaking out to the bandits."
    j "要是我像奥利一样，我肯定会因为你不听我的话、还偷偷跑去找强盗，整整训你一年。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_169a8da3:

    # e "He would. But he'd mean it well."
    e "他会的。不过，他也是出于好意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_43783ae1:

    # j "I know. He is a good lizard overall."
    j "我知道。总的来说，他是条好蜥蜴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_920f7c52:

    # j "It's not like he did me anything wrong. Sometimes I was just paranoid."
    j "他又没对我做过什么坏事。只是有时候，我太过疑神疑鬼了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_434160a3:

    # j "I hate that feeling, but it keeps coming back and I never know what to do."
    j "我讨厌那种感觉，可它总是卷土重来，我永远不知道该怎么办。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_1fa9872d:

    # j "It was there all the time when I saw you, like when I see everyone else."
    j "我见到你时，那种感觉一直都在，就像见到其他所有人时一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_57157362:

    # j "And that feeling, it makes me do something I'd regret, which makes me just much more scared."
    j "而那种感觉会让我做出日后会后悔的事，这又让我更加害怕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_7f8629fd:

    # j "I don't ever want to feel like that again."
    j "我再也不想有那种感觉了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_a8587b60:

    # e "I wouldn't let that happen, Jog."
    e "我不会让那种事发生的，乔格。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_b4fa3fc0_2:

    # j "..."
    j "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_18192d59:

    # "The hyena looks up for the first time in a while."
    "那只鬣狗隔了好一会儿，才第一次抬起头来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_ee9d2cd5:

    # j "I guess I'll trust you, for whatever's worth."
    j "我想我会相信你吧，不管这份信任值不值得。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_f6115226:

    # j "But... yeah. I'm gonna stop with the downer talk."
    j "不过……嗯。我不说这些丧气话了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_4e593c82:

    # j "Well, what's the thing I promised I'd reward you again?"
    j "对了，我答应过要奖励你的东西是什么来着？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_70007cd8:

    # e "You promised to teach me a skill?"
    e "你答应教我一个技能？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Ask_End_b9cdc77a:

    # j "Oh."
    j "哦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_d84c5efc:

    # j "He was talking about me, what do you think?" nointeract
    j "他刚才说的是我，你觉得呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_d6ad2897:

    # e "I think he was talking about another hyena? Mayb-"
    e "我觉得他说的是另一只鬣狗？也许-"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_724c769b:

    # j "Oh? What a conincidence, well I'm letting you know now, he is talking about me."
    j "哦？真巧啊，那我现在告诉你，他说的就是我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_5b41a77f:

    # j "He knew me."
    j "他认识我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_2c803b14:

    # j "Now, am I the one that helped them?"
    j "现在看来，帮过他们的人是我吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_900d1dda:

    # e "I was just thinking, maybe you... knew him?"
    e "我只是在想，也许你……认识他？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_3b1aef58:

    # j "Got it, now do you think I helped them get advantage of the village?"
    j "明白了，你觉得是我帮他们占了村子的便宜？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_b6169c96:

    # e "Of course not, I look fondl-"
    e "当然不是，我明明看着很..."

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_e9cbd11b:

    # "Jog looks impatient, he clenches his fist tightly."
    "乔格显得有些不耐烦，紧紧攥起拳头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_cadff56e:

    # j "You all are the same, what did Sebas tell you exactly back then, huh? That I was a backstabbing liar and thief?"
    j "你们全都一个样，当时塞巴斯到底跟你说了什么，嗯？说我是个背后捅刀子的骗子和小偷？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_275c4199:

    # e "Can I-"
    e "我能-"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_e5c080d9:

    # j "That I was born a thief and always a thief and I'm nothing but troubles always?"
    j "说我生来就是小偷，一辈子都是小偷，永远只会惹麻烦？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_553468e1:

    # j "Why don't you say what you've been thinking the first second you see me for the first time?"
    j "你不如直接说出来，从第一次见到我的那一刻起，你一直在想什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_5bfaa31d:

    # "You pause."
    "你停顿了一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_2b3b28c3:

    # j "Now I see why they like you so much. His favourite new roommate, ha."
    j "现在我明白他们为什么那么喜欢你了。他最喜欢的新室友，哈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_f0aa1917:

    # e "Jog, I don't think that was fair-."
    e "乔格，我觉得那样说不太公平-"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_df0f15c8:

    # j "Fair? Fair like everytime time something goes wrong and it's always my problem?"
    j "公平？每次出了什么问题，都成了我的麻烦，这就叫公平？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_fc322f5d:

    # j "Or talking like I was always scheming, taking advantage of his wealth like a hemoworm sucking blood out of its host."
    j "或者说得好像我一直在耍心机，利用他的财富，就像血蛭从宿主身上吸血一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_930479f8:

    # e "Jog, I was just talking about what the rat thief said, nothing else."
    e "乔格，我只是在说那个鼠贼说的话，没别的意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_96c26c67:

    # "You try to calm Jog down a little, but he is still staring right into you."
    "你试着让乔格冷静一点，但他仍直勾勾地盯着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_82fac779:

    # j "Am I a rat too?"
    j "我也是老鼠吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_86f5c891:

    # e "No, Jog. You're not."
    e "不，乔格。你不是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_b4fa3fc0:

    # j "..."
    j "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_a06df48d:

    # "He freezes, suddenly."
    "他突然僵住了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_9e6c091b:

    # e "You're not a thief, you're not a bandit, you're my friend, Jog."
    e "你不是小偷，也不是强盗，你是我的朋友，乔格。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_4cb2f65e:

    # e "And I, really see you as one, no matter what those bandits said."
    e "我也真的把你当朋友，不管那些强盗怎么说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_68b570c3:

    # "The hyena takes a few seconds to calm himself down, he is avoiding your concerned gaze."
    "鬣狗花了几秒钟才平复下来，同时避开你担忧的目光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_c9b014d2:

    # e "I just trust you, the first time I saw you and Amble in the Tavern."
    e "我就是信任你，从第一次在酒馆见到你和安布时起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_b205335d:

    # e "You are a good folk."
    e "你是个好人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_b4fa3fc0_1:

    # j "..."
    j "..."

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_d8a5e1a5:

    # "He was almost at the verge of tears, a few gurgles and coughs away from a full on cry."
    "他几乎要哭出来了，只差几声呜咽和咳嗽，就会彻底哭出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_6dcde1b0:

    # e "Whatever happened in the past, doesn't mean anything to who you are right now."
    e "过去发生的一切，都不能定义现在的你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_fb4e3321:

    # e "And I believe in you, Jog."
    e "我相信你，乔格。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_13da5ec9:

    # "Jog stares at you, bewildered. His eyes are watery, but it looks like he is holding back."
    "乔格困惑地盯着你。他眼里含着泪水，但看起来还在强忍着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_e0264660:

    # e "I think Amble and Lot believe in you too."
    e "我觉得安布和洛特也相信你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_b4fa3fc0_2:

    # j "..."
    j "..."

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_bef66ed7:

    # j "W-would you please buzz off?"
    j "请、请你走开好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_9240fc72:

    # "You don't dare to look at Jog's face, he hides himself pretty far away from you as well."
    "你不敢看乔格的脸，而他也躲得离你远远的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_97b88a39:

    # j "We'll talk later."
    j "我们之后再谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_5e88868a:

    # "By his own accord, he probably was once a part of the bandit. But it mustn't be easy to be accused of something he didn't do."
    "他大概曾自愿成为强盗团伙的一员。不过，被指控做了自己没做过的事，肯定不好受。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_62dd8021:

    # "But you eventually oblige, leaving him alone to his own thoughts."
    "但你最终还是顺了他的意，让他独自沉浸在自己的思绪中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_04e6ebfe:

    # "You see Amble walking straight towards him, he doesn't even greet you normally as he does."
    "你看见安布径直朝他走去，他甚至没有像平时那样和你打招呼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Bandit_Accuse_End_c43b2bee:

    # "You can only hope some time later he will return to his normal jovial self."
    "你只能希望，过些时候他会恢复往日开朗的样子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_End_c73fa029:

    # j "Hey."
    j "嘿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_End_f66a4f49:

    # "Jog walks towards you, with a sluggish pace."
    "乔格步履迟缓地朝你走来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_End_f5130342:

    # e "Hello, Jog."
    e "你好，乔格。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_End_23c0170f:

    # "You two both doesn't talk, resorting into a contest of awkward gaze."
    "你们两人都没有说话，陷入一场尴尬的对视较量。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_End_3eaf962a:

    # j "Last time, I wasn't myself."
    j "上次我状态不对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_End_7b21da20:

    # j "Thanks for not leaving me, well, until I tell you so, but."
    j "谢谢你没有离开我——呃，在我让你走之前。不过……"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_End_fcf8c0dc:

    # j "Uh."
    j "呃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_End_d606e5c5:

    # j "Thanks for your words."
    j "谢谢你这么说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_End_1de57cfc:

    # j "Amble talked with me after, I wasn't being a good friend to you, putting you through all that."
    j "安布后来和我谈过，我让你经历了那些事，实在算不上一个好朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_End_cf926f23:

    # e "It really wasn't your fault, Jog."
    e "那真的不是你的错，乔格。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_End_fbadbfc3:

    # e "We all have moments of outbursts like that sometimes."
    e "我们有时都会有那样情绪爆发的时候。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_End_4d5a8698:

    # j "It just felt weird what you were doing, I didn't expect that."
    j "只是你当时的做法让我觉得有些奇怪，我没想到你会那样做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_End_8dbb424d:

    # "He pauses for a moment again, giving you a slight grin."
    "他又停顿了片刻，朝你露出一丝微笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_End_6f17c344:

    # j "I cried really uglily there, weren't I?"
    j "我刚才哭得特别难看，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_End_68988311:

    # j "That wasn't hot at all. On a matter of fact, pretty boner-killing."
    j "一点也不性感。说真的，简直扫兴到让人硬不起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Return_Bandit_End_063c5c0b:

    # j "But, yeah. I promised you a reward, so let's get this over with."
    j "不过，既然我答应过要给你奖励，那我们就赶紧把这事办完吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Teach_Critical_Skill_5d54ff17:

    # j "This is what I call, Piercing Blow."
    j "这就是我所说的“穿刺打击”。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Teach_Critical_Skill_63669387:

    # j "It's not about blowing your enemy's cock, by the way."
    j "顺便说一句，这可不是要吹你敌人的鸡巴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Teach_Critical_Skill_3cb61074:

    # "Jog points at his squinting eyes."
    "乔格指了指自己眯起的双眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Teach_Critical_Skill_7e9f71be:

    # j "Here, you just take your time for a moment to look at their weakspot."
    j "你只要花点时间，仔细观察他们的弱点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Teach_Critical_Skill_3d54de6b:

    # j "And when you attack, you guarantee to hit them really hard."
    j "而当你发起攻击时，就能保证狠狠命中对方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Teach_Critical_Skill_9d6b492a:

    # j "One thing is that, when you look at them closely, you expose your vulnerable self to their attacks."
    j "不过，仔细观察他们时，你也会把脆弱的自己暴露在对方的攻击之下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Teach_Critical_Skill_cd80767d:

    # e "Can I just, not look at them as closely?"
    e "我能不能别看得那么仔细？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Teach_Critical_Skill_c864c818:

    # j "Then you can't find their weakspots, you oaf."
    j "那样你就找不到他们的弱点了，你这个蠢货。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Teach_Critical_Skill_cdde08af:

    # j "So, knowing when to use them is a huge skill you need to learn to become a master."
    j "所以，知道什么时候该使用它们，是你想成为主人必须学会的一项重要技巧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Teach_Critical_Skill_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Teach_Critical_Skill_e57fdf58:

    # j "That's it, it's not much but I suppose you'll learn that really quickly."
    j "就是这样，没什么复杂的，不过我想你很快就能学会。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Teach_Critical_Skill_6f0d9a97:

    # j "And I'm lazy so I gotta take my leave now, here's the gold I promised. See you later, [e]."
    j "我这人又懒，所以现在得先走了。这是我答应给你的金币。回头见，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Teach_Critical_Skill_8333c200:

    # e "See you."
    e "回头见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Teach_Critical_Skill_48a0e297:

    # msg "You learned the skill 'Piercing Blow'."
    msg "你学会了技能“穿刺打击”。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Teach_Critical_Skill_3e48f566:

    # msg "You received 250 experience points."
    msg "你获得了250点经验值。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_5d3a34ab:

    # "You find Jog tapping his foot impatiently."
    "你发现乔格正不耐烦地轻敲着地面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_452da39b:

    # j "Took you long enough."
    j "你可真够慢的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_8f8d2253:

    # a "Ignore him, you're fine. We do need to talk to you about something though."
    a "别理他，你没事。可是，我们确实有件事要跟你谈谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_d4dc1b17:

    # "You can't really think of anything they might want from you – maybe something happened with the landsharks?"
    "你实在想不出他们有什么事会找你——难道是陆鲨那边出了什么事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_7928d363:

    # e "Did something bad happen?"
    e "出什么不好的事了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_b9f08a04:

    # j "Yes!"
    j "是的！"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_9a58adc6:

    # a "No."
    a "不。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_42aa881c:

    # "They both look at each other for a moment."
    "两人都互相看了一会儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_ec344aee:

    # ja "Maybe."
    ja "也许吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_18c86859:

    # e "...alright, well, what's the maybe bad thing that's happened?"
    e "……好吧，那这个“也许不好的事”到底是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_683809ce:

    # j "Well, we know you've been over in werewolf territory recently."
    j "我们知道你最近去过狼人领地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_caa85629:

    # "You never told him that, but sure."
    "你从没告诉过他这事，不过行吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_a22eebf6:

    # j "And we found one over in the farmlands."
    j "而且我们在农田那边发现了一只。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_0d9d47b1:

    # e "Was he attacking people?!"
    e "他在袭击人吗？！"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_7695b917:

    # "This time it's Amble's time to step in."
    "这次轮到安布插话了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_363760c0:

    # a "No... not as far as we can tell, but it's got the farmers on edge."
    a "不……至少据我们所知没有，但这已经让农民们提心吊胆了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_cc863ce7:

    # a "Nothing like a big bad wolf right outside your home to scare you senseless."
    a "没什么比一头凶恶的大狼出现在你家门外，更能把你吓得魂不附体了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_214b3a22:

    # "That... doesn't really sound like any of the regular werewolves you know. They'd have attacked the farmers immediately."
    "这……听起来不太像你所知道的那些普通狼人。他们早就会立刻袭击农民了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_4896c26c:

    # e "Do you know what they're doing out there?"
    e "你知道它们在那边做什么吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_238e7597:

    # "Jog shifts uncomfortably."
    "乔格不自在地挪了挪身子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_0aaae29e:

    # j "That's what bothers me. Nobody can figure it out."
    j "这正是让我烦恼的地方。没人弄得明白。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_4f3593c2:

    # j "He somehow always knows when I'm watching, and leaves before I can see what he's up to."
    j "他不知怎么的总能察觉我在看他，还没等我看清他在做什么，就先离开了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_24ec5dc0:

    # a "And whenever somebody musters up the courage to walk up and talk to him, he gets up and disappears without a word."
    a "每当有人鼓起勇气走上前去和他搭话，他就会起身，一言不发地消失。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_915505cd:

    # "...That's even weirder. A quiet werewolf?"
    "……这就更奇怪了。一个安静的狼人？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_dd1adb9a:

    # "A thought begins scratching at your brain."
    "一个念头开始在你的脑海中作祟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_bce509eb:

    # e "What would this werewolf happen to look like?"
    e "这个狼人长什么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_dd3a3bbc:

    # "Jog's posture returns to confidence, something much more natural for him."
    "乔格的姿态恢复了自信，这对他来说自然多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_15eefad1:

    # j "Oh, that's easy. He's hot as hell."
    j "哦，这很简单。他帅得要命。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_a0212c50:

    # "Goddamnit."
    "该死。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_891fc0e8:

    # j "Okay, fine, you're no fun. He's a massive, dark blue werewolf with a big belly and rippling muscles."
    j "好吧好吧，你真没意思。他是个庞大的深蓝色狼人，肚子很大，肌肉也一块块隆起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_88df1c6a:

    # "Yeah, that's pretty much what you expected."
    "对，这基本就是你预想的样子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_30d8bc35:

    # j "He's also got this weird curved sword we think he's been using to cut grass in the area?"
    j "他还有一把古怪的弯刀，我们觉得他一直在用它割这附近的草？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_6bd0085d:

    # j "Any idea who that might be?"
    j "你知道那人可能是谁吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_2bd43118:

    # e "Yeah. That's a guy called Wuldon."
    e "对。那人叫伍尔顿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_44a9a229:

    # e "He's just gathering medicine for a very sick friend of his."
    e "他只是在为一位病得很重的朋友采药。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_48ed2b12:

    # a "Oh. Good. We were pretty sure he meant no harm, but..."
    a "哦，那就好。我们基本确定他没有恶意，不过……"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_afbdf4b1:

    # a "We still need to talk to him. The farmers aren't going to take kindly to letting him stick around."
    a "我们还是得跟他谈谈。农夫们可不会乐意让他继续留下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_c53b9c84:

    # "Wuldon's probably not going to react very well to either of these two telling him to stop getting medicine for Vurro."
    "要是这两人中的任何一个叫伍尔顿别再为伏罗取药，他大概都不会有什么好反应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_fd4be28f:

    # "Maybe it'd work if you asked?"
    "也许你去问问会有用？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_83797f01:

    # e "Don't worry about it, I'll go talk to him. Thanks for telling me about this."
    e "别担心，我去和他谈谈。谢谢你告诉我这件事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_a1c75126:

    # a "No problem, and thanks for taking care of it."
    a "不用客气，也谢谢你来处理这件事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_e4191a2a:

    # j "Make sure to ask him how he could always tell where I was!"
    j "记得问问他，他怎么总能知道我在哪里！"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_abda1e4a:

    # e "Got it, got it. I'll talk to you guys later."
    e "知道了，知道了。我晚点再和你们聊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Wuldon_Quest_37e1f1c3:

    # "Well. You've got a werewolf to go convince."
    "好吧。你还有个狼人要去说服呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_18fe3705:

    # e "Jog, I'm here for training."
    e "乔格，我来训练了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_e600cd0a:

    # "Jog hops down from his haybale."
    "乔格从草垛上跳下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_f785cef8:

    # j "Perfect timing. Let's go."
    j "来得正好，走吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_c4086d54:

    # e "Where are we going?"
    e "我们要去哪里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_20b80bf1:

    # j "The bushes near the forest will be fine."
    j "森林边上的灌木丛就挺不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_b9f6bb9c:

    # e "What are we going to do?"
    e "去那里干什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_7428efc6:

    # j "You'll find out."
    j "到了你自然会知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_a838e0e0:

    # e "Do I need to prepare anything?"
    e "我需要准备什么吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_82d7ded8:

    # j "Just bring your handsome self there."
    j "你只要带上你这张帅脸来就行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_ea03e3b9:

    # j "And enough with the 20 questions. I'll meet you there."
    j "别再像十万个为什么似的问个没完了。我在那儿等你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_1962914c:

    # "You are about to suggest that you two can travel there together, but as you turn the corner, you see he's already disappeared."
    "你正想提议你们一起去那里，可刚拐过弯，便发现他已经消失了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_8491e5b8:

    # "You arrive at the forest. The place is peaceful and serene."
    "你来到森林。这里一片宁静祥和。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_6248a843:

    # "Jog is nowhere to be found."
    "哪儿都找不到乔格的身影。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_bcde38c5:

    # e "Jog? Are you there?"
    e "乔格？你在吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_02cda242:

    # "The only answer you get is the chirping of birds."
    "回应你的只有鸟儿的啁啾声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_4211b0c4:

    # "Just as you wonder if this is a prank, you feel a pinch on your butt."
    "正当你怀疑自己是不是被耍了时，突然感到屁股被掐了一把。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_33ce38fc:

    # j "That was your punishment for making me wait so long."
    j "让人等这么久，这就是对你的惩罚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_d333a3bf:

    # "Jog appears out of the shadows."
    "乔格从阴影中现身。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_e52165e5:

    # "He is carrying a basket of what appears to be different kinds of berries."
    "他提着一篮子看起来种类各异的浆果。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_5c609639:

    # e "What do you have there, Jog?"
    e "乔格，你拿的是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_43a2d3c1:

    # e "Are we going berry-picking?"
    e "我们要去摘浆果吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_9752d2ec:

    # j "Are we children frolicking through the woods? No."
    j "我们是要像孩子一样在树林里撒欢吗？才不是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_bf07d712:

    # j "I'm going to teach you a skill vital to being a scout."
    j "我要教你一项成为侦察员必不可少的技能。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_924d27d3:

    # e "What is it?"
    e "是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_aaf07927:

    # j "The art of camouflage."
    j "伪装术。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_6df8025b:

    # e "That sounds cool."
    e "听起来挺酷的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_eaa0a922:

    # j "And highly useful."
    j "而且非常实用。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_6cc867db:

    # e "But how are the berries involved?"
    e "但这和浆果有什么关系？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_8582534f:

    # "Jog shakes the basket."
    "乔格晃了晃篮子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_8270ebc0:

    # j "You wouldn't be carrying paint with you out in the wilds, would you?"
    j "你总不会带着颜料跑到荒郊野外来吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_879634cc:

    # e "No."
    e "不会。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_e7da5408:

    # j "Bingo. But these berries can be found everywhere. As long as you know your colors, you can basically mix up any hue you need for the perfect camouflage."
    j "答对了。不过，这些浆果到处都能找到。只要懂得各种颜色，基本上就能调出完美伪装所需的任意色调。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_6ac99167:

    # e "That sounds neat."
    e "听起来不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_85d83fe9:

    # j "Alright. Now, strip."
    j "好了。现在，脱吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_ad8f48d1:

    # "You are surprised by the demand."
    "这个要求让你有些意外。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_790c5b80:

    # e "Strip? Why?"
    e "脱衣服？为什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_e3bc7524:

    # j "Cause berries stain, and I'm not going have you blame me for ruining your clothes later."
    j "因为浆果会染色，我可不想之后你怪我把你的衣服弄坏了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_743e5839:

    # j "Plus, this makes the lesson a lot more fun."
    j "而且这样一来，课程会有趣得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_19022f52:

    # "Jog winks naughtily at you."
    "乔格坏坏地冲你眨了眨眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_4d14a03f:

    # j "Stop wasting time. Get those clothes off."
    j "别浪费时间了。把衣服脱下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_5290c77d:

    # j "You're not shy, are you?"
    j "你不会害羞了吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_5d25027a:

    # e "No..."
    e "才没有……"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_86dfce74:

    # "You strip down to your loincloth."
    "你脱到只剩兜裆布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_57ef6df3:

    # "Even though Jog is also just standing there in his briefs, you can't help but feel a little self-conscious."
    "虽然乔格也只穿着内裤站在那里，你还是不由得感到有些不好意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_c8027eae:

    # "Jog whistles."
    "乔格吹了声口哨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_30de0b66:

    # j "Nice bod."
    j "身材不错嘛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_4b01a27e:

    # e "Jog, focus."
    e "乔格，专心点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_a423411c:

    # j "I am."
    j "我很专心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_a7868852:

    # "He says this as he focuses his eyes on your exposed body."
    "他说着，目光却紧盯着你裸露的身体。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_23236483:

    # e "Jog, be serious."
    e "乔格，认真点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_9660dd78:

    # j "Alright. Loosen up a little... Or I might need to help you."
    j "好啦，放松一点……不然我可能得帮你放松。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_b285ef14:

    # j "Anyway, look at this."
    j "总之，你看这个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_8fb47169:

    # "Jog grabs a handful of blue and golden berries."
    "乔格抓了一把蓝莓和金色浆果。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_35c6c913:

    # "He mulches them in his paw. To your surprise, the berries slowly turn a green color that matches the color of the leaves around you."
    "他在掌中将它们捣碎。令你惊讶的是，浆果慢慢变成了与周围叶子相称的绿色。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_b851e15c:

    # e "That's amazing."
    e "太神奇了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_e7f841e9:

    # "You are genuinely in awe."
    "你由衷地感到震撼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_0e609d17:

    # j "You can get any color you want as long as you know how to combine them."
    j "只要知道怎么混合它们，你就能调出任何想要的颜色。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_52124093:

    # "Jog adds a few more golden berries to the mix, and the color morphs to a brighter emerald shade."
    "乔格又往混合物里添了几颗金莓，颜色变成了更明亮的祖母绿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_f0712253:

    # j "With some shading, you can create the illusion of shadows."
    j "加上一些明暗层次，就能营造出阴影的错觉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_d0a0f53a:

    # j "Plus, you can use more than just berries. Everything around you can be used as a material."
    j "而且，能用的可不只是浆果。身边的一切都可以拿来当材料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_eaee73d2:

    # "To demonstrate, Jog picks up some soil and mashes it with some red berries."
    "为了演示，乔格捡起一些泥土，和几颗红莓一起捣碎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_c46275e1:

    # "The bright redness of the berries becomes more coppery. You then realize what he is trying to mimic."
    "红莓鲜亮的红色变得更偏铜色。你这才意识到他想仿造什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_2a032647:

    # e "Is that blood?"
    e "那是血吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_5fd27299:

    # j "Correct. Or at least, it's fake blood."
    j "没错。或者至少，是假血。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_926d38be:

    # j "Useful when trying to lead your enemies down a false trail."
    j "想把敌人引上歧途时，这东西很有用。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ole_Training_Scene_efcd41db:

    # j "Now, onto the fun part."
    j "现在进入有趣的部分。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_How_Doing_24c5ec78:

    # e "How are you doing, Jog?"
    e "你最近怎么样，乔格？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_How_Doing_e2de1f19:

    # j "Just practicing some archery."
    j "只是在练练箭术。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_How_Doing_3643a1d9:

    # j "I'm the scout of the team."
    j "我是队里的侦察员。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_How_Doing_7319cda1:

    # j "So the team relies on me to get some shots in before we get close and personal with the enemies."
    j "所以，在和敌人近距离交锋前，队伍得靠我先射上几箭。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_How_Doing_1b1650ec:

    # "Then, Jog looks around and lowers his voice to a whisper."
    "乔格四下张望，压低声音，几乎用耳语说道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_How_Doing_629fc2cf:

    # j "Also if you hear anyone around town whispering about a thief fitting my profile."
    j "另外，如果你听到镇上有人在悄悄谈论一个和我特征相符的小偷……"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_How_Doing_01f2d519:

    # j "I can swear that it's not me."
    j "我可以发誓，那不是我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_How_Doing_37a3c5d8:

    # "Jog winks at you."
    "乔格朝你眨了眨眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_How_Doing_5c03ac6b:

    # e "Ehm... Ok."
    e "呃……好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_How_Doing_29227e9d:

    # "You have no idea how to make of it."
    "你完全搞不懂他是什么意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Amble_de56a969:

    # e "What do you think about Amble?"
    e "你怎么看安布？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Amble_68b9f216:

    # j "That block of wood?"
    j "那块木头？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Amble_ecd24179:

    # j "I guess he's alright."
    j "我觉得他还行吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Amble_e291175d:

    # j "Every team must have a meatshield and there you have it."
    j "每支队伍都得有个肉盾，他不就是现成的吗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Amble_f6271eac:

    # e "I don't think he's just a meatshield to you... right?"
    e "我觉得他对你来说不只是个肉盾……对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Amble_fa1e4dd4:

    # j "Not the sharpest nail in the toolbox, if you know what I mean."
    j "他不是工具箱里最锋利的那根钉子，你懂我意思吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Amble_b0dc4a0b:

    # j "But hey. With a body like that, why would you need brain?"
    j "不过话说回来，有那样一副身板，还要什么脑子？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Amble_67274057:

    # "Jog nudges you."
    "乔格用胳膊肘戳了戳你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Amble_7e6abc6c:

    # j "Plus, the view's nice, isn't it?"
    j "再说了，这风景也不错，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lothar_097b2d98:

    # e "What's Lothar to you, Jog?"
    e "乔格，你怎么看洛萨尔？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lothar_3f6bfd29:

    # j "Well, as you must know by now, Lot is the village hero."
    j "嗯，你现在肯定也知道了，洛哥可是村里的英雄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lothar_0404ab33:

    # j "He's also a very GOOD leader!"
    j "他还是个非常——非常出色的领袖！"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lothar_8830de33:

    # "There is a rare trace of sincerity in Jog's tone."
    "乔格的语气中难得流露出一丝真诚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lothar_00be9f9e:

    # e "Ehm..."
    e "呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lothar_b457b0f4:

    # j "You might not have the best impression of Lot."
    j "你对洛哥的印象可能不太好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lothar_8f6a0f8e:

    # j "I know how he might come across sometimes."
    j "我知道他有时候给人的感觉可能不太好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lothar_5c8419e3:

    # j "But he has everyone's best interest at heart."
    j "但他是真心为每个人着想。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lothar_1a60a167:

    # j "Just don't ever tell him that I said these things or I'll never hear the end of it."
    j "你可千万别告诉他我说过这些，不然他会没完没了地念叨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lothar_2b03b73d:

    # e "Ok, I won't tell Lothar..."
    e "好，我不会告诉洛萨尔的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lusterfield_2dedfb7c:

    # e "How is the life in Lusterfield?"
    e "你在卢斯特菲尔德过得怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lusterfield_a619ec14:

    # j "The place's not bad."
    j "这地方还不赖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lusterfield_88861419:

    # j "Born and raised here with Amble."
    j "我和安布在这里出生、长大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lusterfield_1087d040:

    # j "There are some interesting characters around here."
    j "这附近有不少有意思的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lusterfield_8bc16b8b:

    # j "For example, the lizard at the shop."
    j "比如那家店里的蜥蜴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lusterfield_6e665586:

    # j "I don't get why people would go around giving away medicine for free."
    j "我就是不明白，为什么会有人到处免费送药。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lusterfield_bce8c5b8:

    # j "But I ain't complaining."
    j "不过我也没在抱怨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lusterfield_74c54712:

    # j "That means the team has more budget for other things."
    j "那样一来，咱们队就有更多预算买其他东西了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lusterfield_d8aa5cf2:

    # j "And the lion, Sebasti-... Sebas."
    j "还有那头狮子，塞巴斯蒂——塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lusterfield_70887afb:

    # j "Let's just say we have some history."
    j "就这么说吧，我们之间有些过往。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lusterfield_e196989a:

    # e "Hmm? What histor-"
    e "嗯？哪种过——"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lusterfield_b3b6f0fb:

    # j "The tavern barkeep is fine."
    j "酒馆老板人不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lusterfield_d6f478a9:

    # j "At least he doesn't kick us out when Amble is making chaos in his tavern."
    j "安布在他酒馆里闹得一团糟时，至少他不会把我们赶出去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lusterfield_25c7ac3b:

    # j "Rahim makes Lot's armor."
    j "雷希姆给洛哥做护甲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lusterfield_2ed36206:

    # j "Lots of respect for the man."
    j "我很尊敬这个男人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lusterfield_50f340c2:

    # j "But wouldn't you like to see what he's packing?"
    j "不过，你难道不好奇他下面有多少料吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lusterfield_ad4c7271:

    # e "Uhm... I didn't notice."
    e "呃……我没注意到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_Lusterfield_c6a1cf8b:

    # "Jog chuckles."
    "乔格轻笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Dialogue_End_323e23d6:

    # e "That's it, thank you so much for bearing with me, Jog."
    e "就这些了，乔格，谢谢你这么耐心听我说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Dialogue_End_a933d18f:

    # j "Yeah, well. 'Stay sharp, my disciple', heh."
    j "嗯，怎么说呢。“小心点，我的徒弟”，嘿嘿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_51a554e3:

    # "You find Jog and Amble together."
    "你发现乔格和安布在一起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_91452208:

    # "Both of them spot you. Jog nods to acknowledge your presence. Amble waves and greets you."
    "两人都发现了你。乔格点头示意，安布挥手向你打招呼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_19e2fd3e:

    # a "Hey. It's Lot's follower. What are you doing here today and what is it that you're wearing?"
    a "嗨，洛哥的小徒弟。你今天来这里做什么？还有，你穿的是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_ec0ac84a:

    # "you felt two pair of eyes scanning your body."
    "你感觉到两双眼睛正打量着你的身体。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_0533eebe:

    # e "This is an adventurer's outfit made by Rahim. I'm here to get your opinions on it."
    e "这是雷希姆做的探险家套装。我来这里是想听听你们对它的看法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_5fe6030f:

    # j "master Rahim made that for you? It looks like you're not just Lot's favorite."
    j "雷希姆主人专门为你做的？看来你不只是洛哥最喜欢的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_72524946:

    # e "This is just a job. So what do you think of the outfit?"
    e "这只是一份工作而已。你们觉得这套服装怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_471003e9:

    # a "I think it's great."
    a "我觉得很棒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_ca992bed:

    # j "I agree."
    j "我同意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_3b63f3ef:

    # a "It shows off all your assets."
    a "它把你身上的优点全都展现出来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_e2e7b8fc:

    # j "Nice assets you're sporting, by the way."
    j "顺便说一句，你这身材真养眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_d9801d53:

    # a "The straps can be used in first-aid emergency healing."
    a "这些束带还能用于急救治疗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_b7544f1f:

    # j "Or to strap someone down, if you catch my drift."
    j "或者把人捆住——你懂我的意思吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_c6f7b61f:

    # a "Could do without the undershirt though."
    a "不过，里面那件打底衫可以不穿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_2cc9d4bc:

    # j "100 percent."
    j "百分之百。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_cd723d4d:

    # e "I will relay your feedback to rahim."
    e "我会把你们的意见转告雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_ff516529:

    # "Jog and Amble nod. You look at them and something comes to mind."
    "乔格和安布点了点头。你看着他们，忽然想起一件事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_c548d0da:

    # e "While we're on this topic, can I ask a question?"
    e "既然说到这个，我能问个问题吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_3ea0102f:

    # a "Go ahead."
    a "请问吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_8846c244:

    # e "Why are you dressed so minimally as adventurers?"
    e "作为冒险者，你们为什么穿得这么少？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_15174b43:

    # "The two seems surprised by your questions."
    "两人似乎对你的问题感到惊讶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_a7a353c5:

    # a "Of course, it's for intimidation. Normally I would have won half the battle when the enemy sees a giant bulk of muscles stomping towards them."
    a "当然是为了震慑敌人。通常敌人看到一大坨肌肉朝他们跺步走来，我就已经赢下一半了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_7dca3914:

    # "Amble flexes his muscles."
    "安布绷紧了肌肉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_3e32b0c9:

    # j "It's for agility and flexibility. Less of a chance to get hooked on stuff. Plus, it cuts down the time to get to the fun time of any battle."
    j "为了灵活敏捷，也更不容易被什么东西勾住。而且还能缩短等到每场战斗最有趣部分的时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_3e05971e:

    # "Jog grins at you invitingly."
    "乔格带着邀请意味地冲你咧嘴一笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_406fe208:

    # j "You should try it and see where it gets you."
    j "你应该试试看，看看会有什么结果。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_cf292d90:

    # "you swallows nervously."
    "你紧张地咽了咽口水。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_01_700dc167:

    # e "Alright. Thanks for the feedback."
    e "好吧。谢谢你们的反馈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_03_51a554e3:

    # "You find Jog and Amble together."
    "你发现乔格和安布在一起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_03_91452208:

    # "Both of them spot you. Jog nods to acknowledge your presence. Amble waves and greets you."
    "他们俩都注意到了你。乔格点头示意你的到来，安布挥手向你打招呼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_03_be96019e:

    # a "That is a cute outfit but definitely not suitable for combat. You'll most likely trip on yourself."
    a "这身打扮很可爱，但绝对不适合战斗。你很可能会被自己绊倒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_03_c19be9cb:

    # j "Another ingenius way to submit yourself to the opponent."
    j "又一种把自己送到对手手里的绝妙方式。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_03_f89941c7:

    # a "But it's cute for wearing around town. It makes me want to wrap you up and take you home."
    a "不过穿着它在镇上到处走倒是很可爱。让我忍不住想把你裹起来带回家。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_03_109288fb:

    # j "Yes. You're tied up with a knot. Makes me want to open you up like a present."
    j "没错，你身上系着个结，让我想把你像礼物一样拆开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_03_191343ce:

    # e "Hmm... Alright- alright... I get it. Thank you!"
    e "嗯……好吧，好吧……我明白了。谢谢你们！"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_b05d5fac:

    # "Once you walk up to the shooting range, both Jog and Amble come up to you."
    "一走到靶场，乔格和安布就朝你走了过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_f4c74ba3:

    # e "Hey, guys. This..."
    e "嗨，伙计们。这套……"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_cf022a63:

    # "Before you can start explaining, they have started to examine your outfit."
    "你还没来得及开始解释，他们就已经开始打量你的穿着了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_a647213c:

    # "Their pats around your thighs and crotch turn you on slightly."
    "他们在你大腿和胯间周围拍摸，让你微微性兴奋起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_82cad102:

    # "You wish you could hide the boner you're starting to have, but the outfit makes it impossible."
    "你希望能藏住开始勃起的阴茎，可这身衣服让你根本无从遮掩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_3b4a2baf:

    # e "Guys, stop."
    e "伙计们，停下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_54d2fbed:

    # e "Guys... stop."
    e "伙计们……停下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_bb15fe1e:

    # "Amble obliges but not Jog. At least, it's better than nothing."
    "安布照做了，乔格却没有。至少，总比什么都没有好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_14663823:

    # "You try to calm down but it's hard with Jog's fingers trailing along your new outfit."
    "你试着冷静下来，可乔格的手指不停沿着你的新衣服游走，让这实在很难。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_ba1b5f65:

    # "You are determined to finish your quest, so you turn your attention to Amble."
    "你下定决心完成任务，于是把注意力转向安布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_828d35d2:

    # e "What do you like about this new outfit? You two seem to be more into it than the actual adventurer's armor."
    e "你喜欢这套新衣服的什么地方？你们两个似乎比起真正的冒险者铠甲，更喜欢它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_44b857bb:

    # a "Because it's quite reminiscent of our attire, other than the strange thing that's wrapped around your legs that is."
    a "因为它和我们的穿着很像——除了你腿上裹着的那个奇怪东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_18aafa8e:

    # a "Did Lothar put you up to this?"
    a "这是洛萨尔让你这么做的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_18bc9b0b:

    # "You couldn't help but pause at the implication of that question."
    "你不禁因这句话暗示的意味停顿了一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_0ae009ea:

    # "Are Amble and Jog only in their underwear on Lothar's order?"
    "难道安布和乔格平时只穿内裤，是洛萨尔下的命令？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_0dbe3672:

    # "You find that to be quite hot."
    "你觉得这可真够刺激的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_9a8da447:

    # "Suddenly, a series of popping sound draws you out of your reverie."
    "突然，一连串啪嗒声将你从遐想中拉了回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_caa6fb91:

    # j "Hey. The pants are meant to be removed. You only need to pull the buttons on the belt."
    j "嘿，这条裤子本来就是要脱下来的。你只要扯开腰带上的纽扣就行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_7e5387f1:

    # a "Really? That is a great design. Now, you really look like a part of the team."
    a "真的？这设计太棒了。现在你看起来确实像我们的一员了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_77414c90:

    # "You can feel the chaps sliding down as Jog's nimble fingers undo the buttons expertly."
    "乔格灵巧的手指熟练地解开纽扣，你感觉到那条套裤滑了下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_f7b181d2:

    # "You quickly slaps Jog's hand away and grab the chaps before they fully fall off, leaving you there only in your briefs."
    "你连忙拍开乔格的手，在套裤完全滑落前一把抓住它，让自己不至于只剩内裤站在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_40934724:

    # e "Guys. Stop joking. That's not how the outfit is meant to be used."
    e "你们两个，别闹了。这套衣服不是这么用的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_169797ae:

    # "Although at the back of your mind, you wonder if you were wrong and they were right."
    "尽管如此，你心底还是怀疑，或许错的是你，而他们才是对的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_8c3c6de3:

    # "After all, the outfit was meant for the tavern."
    "毕竟，这套衣服本来就是为酒馆准备的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_7de89526:

    # "Either way, you need to escape before things get even more out of hand."
    "不管怎样，你得在事态变得更加失控前逃走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_89fc3091:

    # "You snap the buttons back on and turn away from the shooting range."
    "你啪地扣好纽扣，转身背离射击场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_4bcca145:

    # j "Hey, we're not done examining the outfit yet!"
    j "嘿，我们还没检查完这套衣服呢！"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Amble_Outfit_02_46c6ab29:

    # a "That's right."
    a "没错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Dialogue_aa9a8699:

    # e "Hello, Amble."
    e "你好，安布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Dialogue_588ac63f:

    # a "Hey, [e]."
    a "嘿，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Dialogue_d8d1bf2e:

    # a "You're... dressing like us now, only without the jock part."
    a "你现在穿得跟我们一样了，只是少了护裆而已。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Dialogue_f9e67d67:

    # a "Hey, [e]... Haven't seen you around here before..."
    a "嘿，[e]……之前没在这附近见过你……"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Dialogue_23c16d36:

    # e "I was just walking around the village and I discovered you two!"
    e "我刚才只是在村子里随便逛逛，没想到碰见了你们俩！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Dialogue_9c83f499:

    # a "We don't mind. Come more often... now that you're one of us."
    a "我们不介意。现在你也是我们的一员了，有空就常来……"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Dialogue_d70ab2fe:

    # e "Am I? I didn't even get to know you and jog that much since the last time..."
    e "是吗？自从上次见面以来，我都还没怎么了解过你和乔格……"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Dialogue_0204a4bf:

    # a "We're always here, if we're not already out hunting in the afternoon."
    a "只要下午不是出去打猎，我们基本都在这儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Dialogue_09955b5a:

    # a "Treat yourself like your home, this is where we usually practice."
    a "别拘束，就当这里是自己家——我们平时都在这儿练习。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Dialogue_71c9810a:

    # e "Didn't Lothar have the training dummy?"
    e "洛萨尔不是有个训练用的人偶吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Dialogue_1658385d:

    # a "It's his. The dummies here never move, so there's one less thing to worry about."
    a "是他的。这里的人偶从来不会动，也就少了一件需要担心的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Dialogue_d896417d:

    # e "Oh... Thanks, Amble."
    e "噢……谢啦，安布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Dialogue_aa9a8699_1:

    # e "Hello, Amble."
    e "嗨，安布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Dialogue_588ac63f_1:

    # a "Hey, [e]."
    a "嘿，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Normal_Talk_5ce11562:

    # a "[e]? What's on your mind?" nointeract
    a "[e]？你的小脑袋在想些什么呢？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Normal_Talk_e1b4b9b5:

    # e "What about the other dudes?"
    e "其他人呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Normal_Talk_602e6952:

    # a "My team?" nointeract
    a "我的伙伴？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_de33b095:

    # e "Amble, do you have some time?"
    e "安布，你有空吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_ebb2afb6:

    # a "Sure."
    a "当然。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_a09ee073:

    # e "You and Jog have been travelling much longer than I am."
    e "你和乔格四处旅行的时间可比我长多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_b760ddd9:

    # a "Correct."
    a "没错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_026bfe9f:

    # e "So that you means you have more battle experience."
    e "也就是说，你们的战斗经验更丰富。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_210c06eb:

    # a "Yes."
    a "当然。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_0ceac477:

    # e "In that case, Amble, do you have any battle skills that you can teach me?"
    e "这样的话，安布，请问你有没有什么战斗技巧可以教教我？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_5b9749a1:

    # a "Hmm... I think so."
    a "唔……应该有喔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_28765077:

    # e "That's great."
    e "那太好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_0ae7ddde:

    # e "When do you think you can teach me?"
    e "你觉得什么时候可以教我？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_03c75f9b:

    # a "How about now, my puny friend?"
    a "要不就现在吧，我的小不点朋友？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_577e4bd1:

    # e "Okay."
    e "好啊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_f78c2279:

    # "A voice travels from the other end of the archery field."
    "一道声音从射箭场的另一头传来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_8b47b126:

    # j "Hold on a second!"
    j "等一下！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_6db0516e:

    # "You and Amble turn around to see Jog tapping his feet and staring at you."
    "你和安布转过身，只见乔格一边跺着脚，一边盯着你们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_c32ee83b:

    # j "Are you here on Lot's behest?"
    j "你是洛萨尔让你来的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_a817dd70:

    # e "Not really. But it's for the courier training..."
    e "不完全是。不过是为了信使训练……"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_92965c87:

    # "Jog interrupts you."
    "乔格打断了你的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_801288ab:

    # j "Sorry, friend. Can't help you there. Our training in Lusterfield is supervised by Lot."
    j "我们在卢斯特菲尔德的训练都由洛萨尔监管。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_3643c182:

    # j "We're not doing any extra training without going through him first."
    j "不先经过他的同意，我们不能进行任何额外训练。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_d4993d94:

    # e "But..."
    e "可是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_5b089749:

    # j "We don't make the rules."
    j "规矩不是我们定的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_59ad9096:

    # "You turn to Amble for help."
    "你转向安布求助。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_1c8a96c3:

    # "Amble shrugs."
    "安布耸了耸肩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_2b87488f:

    # a "What Jog says is right. Need to notify Lot first."
    a "乔格说得没错。得先通知洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_681e3962:

    # "You sigh."
    "你叹了口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_e53c6fed:

    # e "Alright..."
    e "好吧……"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Lothar_d0e7ea2d:

    # e "Alright. I got the permission from Lothar. He says the training is a go."
    e "好吧。我已经得到洛萨尔的许可了。他说可以进行训练。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Lothar_db60e514:

    # a "Awesome. I knew he would agree. He's such a nice person."
    a "太棒了。我就知道他会同意。他真是个好人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Lothar_3f7c5517:

    # j "Color me surprised. I was a bit 50-50 on the result. I guess he does like you."
    j "真让我意外。我本来还觉得结果有点五五开。看来他确实喜欢你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Lothar_546aaac0:

    # "You are not so sure about that. The person Lothar likes is probably himself."
    "你对此不太确定。洛萨尔喜欢的人，大概只有他自己。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Lothar_38dc0924:

    # e "So, back to the skill training."
    e "那么，回到技能训练上吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Lothar_681d664c:

    # a "Yes. This is fun. [e], I'll teach you how to properly crush the enemy in battle."
    a "没错。这可有意思了。[e]，我来教你如何在战斗中彻底击溃敌人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Lothar_2ee980da:

    # e "Sounds good."
    e "听起来不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Lothar_617164c3:

    # a "But I'll have to get things prepared first. Give me some time?"
    a "不过我得先准备一下。能给我点时间吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Lothar_2e8a5fe0:

    # e "Of course."
    e "当然。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Lothar_a1134b02:

    # a "See you back here later, [e]."
    a "过会儿我们在这里见，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Lothar_70ddc782:

    # "Amble gets into the idea of the training faster than you anticipate. He trundles off to make his preparation."
    "安布比你预想中更快接受了训练这件事，随即慢悠悠地跑去做准备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Lothar_085bcf34:

    # "After Amble leaves, Jog eyes you from his perch."
    "安布离开后，乔格从他栖身的地方瞥了你一眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Lothar_5dff4ad8:

    # e "So Jog, will you teach me some new skills too?"
    e "那么，乔格，你也愿意教我一些新技能吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Lothar_b96acf5d:

    # "Jog ponders."
    "乔格思索了一番。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Lothar_a3fd992c:

    # j "Eh, why not? Like the blockhead said, this will be fun."
    j "呃，为什么不呢？就像那个木头脑袋说的，这会很有趣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Lothar_467ca80f:

    # "Jog's eyes glow with a mischievous glint."
    "乔格的眼中闪烁着淘气的光芒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Lothar_089d7b97:

    # j "Similarly, I too need to prepare for this lesson. I assure you this lesson will be fun for us both."
    j "我也得为这堂课做些准备。我保证，这对我们俩来说都会很有趣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Lothar_a60a6a96:

    # e "...Okay."
    e "……好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Lothar_fd27dbb3:

    # "Jog rustles away."
    "乔格窸窸窣窣地跑远了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Lothar_Training_a39ae20a:

    # a "A training? Are you sure you can handle it, puny thing?"
    a "训练？你确定自己应付得来吗，小不点？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Lothar_Training_33fa59ca:

    # a "We heard from Lot that you can barely handle yourself against a slime."
    a "我们听洛哥说，你对付一只史莱姆都够呛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Lothar_Training_89eee3c7:

    # e "That is not true. I've beaten many slimes on my journey."
    e "那不是真的。我一路上可是打败过很多史莱姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Lothar_Training_01894521:

    # a "That's not what he said."
    a "他可不是这么说的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Lothar_Training_c08d8386:

    # "You really don't know what to say."
    "你还真是不知道该说什么了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Lothar_Training_84b16e0b:

    # "Amble sizes you up and down."
    "安布上下打量着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Lothar_Training_cc759cb6:

    # a "Regardless, he did say that you are to go on a training with me."
    a "不管怎么说，他确实说过你要和我一起接受训练。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Lothar_Training_37d399ce:

    # a "It'll prove that whether you have the strength to be part of the team or not."
    a "这样就能证明你到底有没有足够的力气成为团队的一员。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Lothar_Training_9d2f2d12:

    # e "Alright."
    e "好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Lothar_Training_64c7bbd9:

    # a "Come with me and be prepared for a grueling training session."
    a "跟我来，做好接受艰苦训练的准备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Lothar_Training_dec7ccff:

    # "You anticipate a strenuous physical exercise as you follow Amble to the Sparkling Lagoon."
    "你跟着安布前往苍耀湖，预想这会是一场艰苦的体能训练。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Lothar_Training_bc380d88:

    # "You two stop at the forest near the lagoon."
    "你们俩在湖泊附近的森林里停了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Lothar_Training_5d45a640:

    # a "Alright, puny dragon. Start chopping."
    a "好吧，小不点龙。开始砍树。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Lothar_Training_ecb1401c:

    # "With you looking on in shock, Amble grabs the axe off his back and starts hacking at a giant tree."
    "你震惊地看着，安布从背后取下斧头，开始劈砍一棵大树。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Lothar_Training_92796454:

    # "Amble pauses and looks at you with confusion."
    "安布停了下来，困惑地看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Lothar_Training_9aedd728:

    # a "Of course. This is how I normally train my strength. Lot wants you to get stronger like him, right?"
    a "当然了。这就是我平时锻炼力量的方法。洛哥想让你变得像他一样强壮，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Lothar_Training_121d1a20:

    # a "This is the most effective way."
    a "这是最有效的方法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Lothar_Training_a899c8ab:

    # "Amble points to an axe on the ground."
    "安布指向地上的一把斧头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Lothar_Training_d76bdb54:

    # a "That's another one of my axes. You can use it."
    a "那是我的另一把斧头，你可以用它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Lothar_Training_7dc58651:

    # "Amble resumes his work. You pick up the axe and ponder your situation."
    "安布继续手头的工作。你捡起斧头，思索着自己的处境。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Lothar_Training_7ab8df83:

    # "There is a big tree and a small tree near you."
    "你附近有一棵大树和一棵小树。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Lothar_Training_10176b4e:

    # "The big tree is about the size of the tree Amble is chopping. It dwarfs you easily. Chopping this down will require a lot of energy."
